-- ============================================================
-- Warrior (Protection): One-Handed Weapon Specialization
--   avoidance -> critical strike chance
-- ============================================================
-- Arms' Two-Handed Weapon Specialization buys parry with crit
-- (woa_2026_08_07_13.sql, retuned in woa_2026_08_08_04.sql).  Protection's
-- One-Handed Weapon Specialization is the mirror: it buys crit with
-- avoidance.  While a one-handed weapon is equipped, your melee critical
-- strike chance is increased by 10/20/30/40/50% of your dodge chance plus
-- your parry chance.  The stock 2/4/6/8/10% one-handed damage bonus on
-- Effect1 is kept exactly as it is.
--
-- The two talents can never feed each other.  Both spells carry
-- EquippedItemClass 2 with mutually exclusive EquippedItemSubClassMasks
-- (one-handed 41105 here, two-handed 354 there), so core unapplies one
-- whenever the other applies -- there is no crit -> parry -> crit loop.
--
-- SPELL_AURA_MOD_WEAPON_CRIT_PERCENT (52) rather than SPELL_AURA_MOD_CRIT_PCT
-- (290): 52 is summed through Player::UpdateWeaponDependentCritAuras
-- (Player.cpp:7111) behind a CheckAttackFitToAuraRequirement predicate, so the
-- spell's own EquippedItemClass gate is honoured per weapon slot, and it feeds
-- PLAYER_CRIT_PERCENTAGE -- the field melee crit rolls read -- without
-- touching spell crit.  290 has no item requirement at all.
--
-- EffectDieSides2 is 1, so CalcValue = EffectBasePoints2 + 1 and $s2 renders
-- 10/20/30/40/50 from base points 9/19/29/39/49.
--
-- The amount itself is computed by spell_warr_1h_spec_crit
-- (modules/world_of_alonecraft/src/WarriorParryConversions.cpp), which
-- overwrites the DBC percentage with the derived value on a 2 second
-- heartbeat.  Nothing in Spell.dbc scales one rating off another.
--
-- No spellbook or talent-tree changes: these are retail spell IDs on retail
-- talent 702, so SkillLineAbility and Talent.dbc are untouched and no
-- db-characters companion migration is needed.
--
-- Spells:
--   16538 / 16539 / 16540 / 16541 / 16542
--     = One-Handed Weapon Specialization ranks 1-5
-- ============================================================

-- ------------------------------------------------------------
-- Rank 1: +2% one-handed damage, +10% of (dodge + parry) as crit
